          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Should my site say parish or county?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Parish. That is what Louisiana uses and what local customers expect, so we write Jefferson Parish or Orleans Parish, never county."
